{"track":"r","category":"기초 문법","level":2,"title":"팩토리얼 (반복문)","desc":"<p><code>n!</code>(= 1×2×…×n)을 <b>반복문</b>으로 구하는 <code>factorial_loop(n)</code>을 만드세요. <code>0! = 1</code> 이에요.</p>","solution":"factorial_loop <- function(n) {\n  result <- 1\n  for (i in seq_len(n)) {\n    result <- result * i\n  }\n  result\n}\n","hint":"<p>곱의 시작값은 1이에요. <code>seq_len(0)</code> 은 빈 범위라서 n이 0이면 반복하지 않아요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"factorial_loop(0)","expected":1,"visible":true},{"call":"factorial_loop(5)","expected":120,"visible":true},{"call":"factorial_loop(1)","expected":1,"visible":false},{"call":"factorial_loop(10)","expected":3628800,"visible":false}],"starter":"factorial_loop <- function(n) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-311"}